    <string name="setup_title">Set up</string>
    <string name="setup_steps">1. Settings → Device Preferences (or System) → About → press Build 7 times.\n2. Developer options → turn on USB debugging (and Network debugging if the TV has it).\n   On Android 11 and later without network debugging: Wireless debugging → Pair device with pairing code, and enter the port and code below.\n3. Press Connect. When the TV asks \"Allow USB debugging?\", tick Always allow and choose Allow.</string>
